"k":"p","c":["Knockback"]},{"k":"p","c":["1"]},{"k":"p","c":["Pool Limit"]},{"k":"p","c":["50"]},{"k":"p","c":["Blocked by walls"]},{"k":"p","c":["No"]},{"k":"h","c":["Max"]},{"k":"p","c":["Sorbetto is an item pickup in Vampire Survivors. It is also a hidden weapon wielded by ",{"i":"Sprite-Frozenshade.png","w":11,"h":24,"r":"character:frozenshade"}," ",{"t":"Frozenshade","r":"character:frozenshade"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Sorbettos can be found from light sources while the player has ",{"i":"Sprite-Out_of_Bounds_(XII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:out-of-bounds-xii"}," ",{"t":"Out of Bounds (XII)","r":"weapon:out-of-bounds-xii"},". They can also be found on the stage ",{"t":"Whiteout","r":"stage:whiteout"},", or dropped by ",{"i":"Sprite-Hail_from_the_Future_(X).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:hail-from-the-future-x"}," ",{"t":"Hail from the Future (X)","r":"arcana:hail-from-the-future-x"},"."]}],"infobox":[],"sections":[{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Similar to ",{"i":"Sprite-Nduja_Fritta_Tanto.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:nduja-fritta-tanto"}," ",{"t":"Nduja Fritta Tanto","r":"weapon:nduja-fritta-tanto"},", upon picking up the Sorbetto, the player's character begins to breathe a cone of icy wind in the direction they are facing, for 10 seconds. It also has the added effect of freezing the enemies it damaged. It is coded to be a temporary weapon, so it can be affected by different stat increases."]},{"k":"p","c":["Collecting ",{"i":"Sprite-Floor_Chicken.png","w":24,"h":24}," Floor Chicken or ",{"i":"Sprite-Wall_Chicken.png","w":24,"h":24}," Wall Chicken while ",{"i":"Sprite-Frozenshade.png","w":11,"h":24,"r":"character:frozenshade"}," ",{"t":"Frozenshade","r":"character:frozenshade"}," is at max health has a chance of activating Sorbetto."]},{"k":"p","c":["Sorbetto is affected by ",{"t":"Gemini (I)","r":"arcana:gemini-i"},", causing it to emit frozen wind behind the character in addition to in front."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 10 April 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Sorbetto is named after the ",{"t":"sorbet","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sorbet"},", a frozen dessert."]},{"c":["The codename for the weapon \"CONEOFCOLD\" is likely a reference to the spell \"Cone of Cold\" in Dungeons and Dragons."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}